## Phase 1 Metrics

**Total Duration:** 35 hours
**Total Tasks:** 85 tasks
**Critical Path:** 18.5 hours (M1.1 → M1.2 → M1.3 → M1.4 → M1.12 → M2.1 → M2.2 → M2.4 → M2.25)

**Parallelization Opportunities:**
- **Day 1 (8h):** M1.1-M1.4 (sequential, 4h) + M3.1-M3.4 (parallel, 4h)
- **Day 2 (8h):** M1.5-M1.11 (parallel, 4h) + M4.1-M4.3 (parallel, 4h)
- **Day 3 (8h):** M2.1-M2.4 (sequential, 6.5h) + M4.4-M4.10 (parallel, 1.5h)
- **Day 4 (8h):** M2.5-M2.12 (parallel, 8h)
- **Day 5 (3h):** M2.13-M2.25 (parallel) + M3.5-M3.30 (parallel) + Integration tests

**Risk Distribution:**
- Low Risk: 60 tasks (71%)
- Medium Risk: 20 tasks (24%)
- High Risk: 5 tasks (5%)

**Resource Allocation:**
- Coder: 40% of tasks
- Tester: 35% of tasks
- Reviewer: 15% of tasks
- Specialized (api-docs, cicd-engineer, perf-analyzer): 10%
